2026-08-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-1080) 'What the three Fly deploys cost
 # uuid: 87f9726d-2490-5268-9716-c1773a8a0aa7
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:attest-in:none
 RFD:Published  1 RFD
 Serials:Weftspun

2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-1080) 'the deploy target
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1080) 'The three Fly deploys have a priced cost, checked live and not estimated.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1080) '`weftspun-studio`, `weftspun-character-taxonomy`, and `weftspun-usd-viewer` all run as real, billed Fly Machines and Volumes now, yet no record states what they cost.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Re-run `flyctl machine list` and `flyctl volumes list` against the three apps to check the sizes behind the total before you cite it. The sections below hold the breakdown by app.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1080) 'What the three Fly deploys cost
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Record it, from Fly's own published pricing page, against this deployment's own real machine sizes, checked live with `flyctl`, not estimated.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1080) '**Total: $0.012845/hour, $9.26/month, $111.12/year**, at today's sizes: three `shared-cpu-1x` machines (two 512MB, one 256MB, the last scaled from Fly's default 2-machine HA pair to one), a 3GB Volume, and a 1GB Volume.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Not included: outbound bandwidth (usage-based, has a free tier before per-GB billing), and any future Tigris usage RFD66606-1073's still-open fetch-path work would add.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1080) 'RFD66606-1062 gives the Fly.io toplevel. RFD66606-1076 gives the `apps/` split across three Fly apps. RFD66606-1079 gives `versitygw`'s removal, no change to this total since it ran inside an already-billed machine.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Source prices
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1080) 'From `fly.io/docs/about/pricing/`, the published rates this breakdown uses directly:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-1080) '| Resource               | Per-second  | Per-month |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1080) '| ---------------------- | ----------- | --------- |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1080) '| `shared-cpu-1x`, 256MB | $0.00000078 | $2.02     |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-1080) '| `shared-cpu-1x`, 512MB | $0.00000128 | $3.32     |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-1080) '| Volume storage         |,           | $0.15/GB  |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Hourly = per-second × 3600. Yearly = per-month × 12, the number Fly itself bills against, not hourly × 8760 (the two differ slightly because a month is not exactly 730 hours; the per-month figure is the one Fly actually charges).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-1080) 'This deployment's real sizes, checked live
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-1080) '`flyctl machine list` and `flyctl volumes list`, run against all three apps, the same session these prices apply to:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-1080) '| App                           | Machine(s)                | Volume |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-1080) '| ----------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------ |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-1080) '| `weftspun-studio`             | 1× `shared-cpu-1x`, 512MB | 3GB    |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-1080) '| `weftspun-character-taxonomy` | 1× `shared-cpu-1x`, 512MB | 1GB    |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-1080) '| `weftspun-usd-viewer`         | 1× `shared-cpu-1x`, 256MB | none   |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-1080) '`weftspun-usd-viewer` started as Fly's default 2-machine HA pair (zero-downtime deploys); scaled to one (`min_machines_running = 0` in its own `fly.toml`, then `flyctl scale count 1`) per the user's own choice of cost over restart-window downtime.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-1080) 'No dedicated IPv4 anywhere (checked with `flyctl ips list` against all three apps): only shared IPv4 and free dedicated IPv6, so no extra per-app IP charge applies.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

