2026-08-25T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-1080) '| **Total**                                  | **$0.012845** | **$9.26** | **$111.12** |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Volume hourly figures divide the monthly rate by 730 (Fly's own average hours-per-month), since Fly bills Volumes monthly, not per-second; machine hourly figures are the real per-second billing rate × 3600, both shown for a like-for-like row.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-1080) 'What this excludes
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-1080) '- **Outbound bandwidth.** Usage-based, not a fixed size like a Machine or a Volume. Fly's free tier covers a baseline before per-GB egress billing starts; this deployment's actual traffic was not measured this session.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-1080) '- **Tigris.** RFD66606-1073's still-open fetch-path work (`apps/usd_viewer_app/` fetching gallery assets from Tigris instead of baking them into its own image) would add real, usage-based storage and bandwidth cost once built. Not yet built, so not yet billed, so not in this total.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-1080) '- **`taskweft-mcp`**, a fourth already-deployed Fly app in the same org, unrelated to the three this RFD scopes (`weftspun-studio`, `weftspun-character-taxonomy`, `weftspun-usd-viewer`). Its own cost is real but out of this RFD's scope.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-1080) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-1080) 'Fly bills Machines by the second and Volumes by the month.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1080  1 LINE
 Text:Written
